main.tf -> it holds the main configuration of terraform script
inside main.tf u have to provide what is provider configuration
provider if it is aws keep aws if it is azure keep azure or GCP and inside braces u have to mention about region.
in resources u have to mention how many resources u have to create.

now i want to create EC2 instance using terraform -> in VS code created folder called Terraform under EC2 folder under EC2 created file main.pf
provider "aws" {                                         => here we have to mention the provider name like AWS or AZURE OR GCP ......
    region = "us-east-1"  # Set your desired AWS region  => here need to mention the region       
}

resource "aws_instance" "example" {                       => here need to mention like resource like, now i want to create EC2 instance so mentiones aws_instance
    ami           = "ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0"  # Specify an appropriate AMI ID
    instance_type = "t2.micro"                            => mention instance type like t2, t3 or large, micro ....
}

now we written the code in main.pf, we have to run few commands to create EC2 instance
